{"4241190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dead Stock", "steam_appid": 4241190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a scavenger crew in a zombie apocalypse. Venture into abandoned supermarkets, loot high-value items, sell them to other survivors, and grow your own post-apocalyptic trading empire. Push a shopping cart through hostile environments, secure loot under pressure, cover your squad, and extract before the horde arrives — friendly fire is always on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by Unreal Engine 5, the game delivers high-fidelity visuals, AAA-quality first-person shooting, and a fully physics-driven experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamwork Is Essential</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player pushes the cart, others scout shelves, plan routes, provide overwatch, engage incoming threats, or carry loot. Every role matters. Once the goods are secured, extract immediately — hesitation means death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight, Loot, and Extract</strong><br>Risk everything for better loot, abandon teammates if necessary, and decide what matters most. Sell your haul, upgrade your gear, and prepare for the next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics Shapes Every Encounter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shopping cart can tip over from uneven weight, get slammed into corners by zombies, or become uncontrollable without coordination. Master the chaos through teamwork — or be overwhelmed.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a scavenger crew in a zombie apocalypse. Venture into abandoned supermarkets, loot high-value items, sell them to other survivors, and grow your own post-apocalyptic trading empire. Push a shopping cart through hostile environments, secure loot under pressure, cover your squad, and extract before the horde arrives — friendly fire is always on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by Unreal Engine 5, the game delivers high-fidelity visuals, AAA-quality first-person shooting, and a fully physics-driven experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamwork Is Essential</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player pushes the cart, others scout shelves, plan routes, provide overwatch, engage incoming threats, or carry loot. Every role matters. Once the goods are secured, extract immediately — hesitation means death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight, Loot, and Extract</strong><br>Risk everything for better loot, abandon teammates if necessary, and decide what matters most. Sell your haul, upgrade your gear, and prepare for the next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics Shapes Every Encounter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shopping cart can tip over from uneven weight, get slammed into corners by zombies, or become uncontrollable without coordination. Master the chaos through teamwork — or be overwhelmed.</p>", "short_description": "An online co-op horror zombie shooter for up to 4 players. Push a shopping cart through supermarkets in a zombie apocalypse, search for high-value items, cover your teammates, and extract safely — but be careful not to hurt each other.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241190/95e9a9d223f5b2f6d997cc730c4f3bafa222444d/header.jpg?t=1775978500", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241190/e6038798bed094e4364c1d7892cdadc08c4ce0d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775978500", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241190/e6038